# .git-blame-ignore-revs
#
# Add commit SHAs here to exclude them from `git blame`.
# Useful for bulk formatting or refactoring commits where
# the diff is large but functionally meaningless.
#
# Usage:
#   git blame --ignore-revs-file .git-blame-ignore-revs <file>
#
# Or set it globally:
#   git config blame.ignoreRevsFile .git-blame-ignore-revs
